{"id":43303,"date":"2025-07-20T14:31:53","date_gmt":"2025-07-20T13:31:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=43303"},"modified":"2026-11-02T20:42:12","modified_gmt":"2026-11-02T19:42:12","slug":"linhas-de-torres-100","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/linhas-de-torres-100\/","title":{"rendered":"Linhas de Torres 100 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Linhas de Torres 100 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Linhas de Torres 100 2027<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>29 e 30 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (sexta-feira e s\u00e1bado), afirmando-se como uma das mais emblem\u00e1ticas travessias de ultra-endurance em Portugal. Com secretariado geral e meta instalados na <strong>Expo Torres<\/strong>, em <strong>Torres Vedras<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o desafia-te a percorrer o hist\u00f3rico sistema defensivo erguido entre 1809 e 1810 a norte de Lisboa para travar as invas\u00f5es napole\u00f3nicas.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A prova rainha de <strong>100 km (LT100 \u2013 K100)<\/strong> \u2014 disputada a solo ou em estafetas de 2 e 4 elementos \u2014 parte na noite de sexta-feira \u00e0s <strong>22:00<\/strong> junto ao <strong>Monumento a H\u00e9rcules e aos Defensores das Linhas de Torres<\/strong>, em <strong>Alhandra<\/strong> (Vila Franca de Xira), atravessando caminhos militares e algumas das 152 fortifica\u00e7\u00f5es que ligam o Tejo ao Atl\u00e2ntico. No s\u00e1bado arrancam os desafios de <strong>50 km (K50)<\/strong> no <strong>Forte do Alqueid\u00e3o<\/strong> (08:15) e de <strong>30 km (K30)<\/strong> em <strong>P\u00earo Negro<\/strong> (09:30), ambos no concelho de <strong>Sobral de Monte Agra\u00e7o<\/strong>, seguidos das provas de <strong>20 km (K20 e C20)<\/strong> no <strong>Furadouro<\/strong> (10:30), <strong>10 km (K10 e C10)<\/strong> no <strong>Carvalhal<\/strong> (11:00\/11:10) e do <strong>Trail Kids (TK)<\/strong> gratuito \u00e0s 15:00 na Expo Torres.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Trilhos do Costume<\/strong>, em parceria com a <strong>Rota Hist\u00f3rica das Linhas de Torres<\/strong> e os munic\u00edpios de Arruda dos Vinhos, Loures, Mafra, Sobral de Monte Agra\u00e7o, Torres Vedras e Vila Franca de Xira, o evento \u00e9 homologado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa<\/strong> e certificado pela <strong>Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA)<\/strong>, integrando os Circuitos Nacionais de Trail Ultra Endurance, Trail Ultra, Trail, Trail Sprint e Circuito Jovem, al\u00e9m de apoiar solidariamente a <strong>APSA \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de S\u00edndrome de Asperger<\/strong>. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 a 30 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Expo Torres, Torres Vedras (Meta e Secretariado), Lisboa<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-