">Fase 3:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (13\/12 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 4:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 24\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">LT100 \u2013 TK (Trail Kids 7-15 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 30 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Linhas de Torres 100 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Linhas de Torres 100 2027 decorre nos dias 29 e 30 de janeiro de 2027. O secretariado, o centro log\u00edstico e a meta de todas as dist\u00e2ncias est\u00e3o sediados na Expo Torres, em Torres Vedras.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os locais e hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na sexta-feira (29 de janeiro), os 100 km (K100 a solo e estafetas K100\/2 e K100\/4) partem \u00e0s 22:00 do Monumento a H\u00e9rcules, em Alhandra (Vila Franca de Xira). No s\u00e1bado (30 de janeiro), o K50 parte \u00e0s 08:15 do N\u00facleo de Apoio ao Forte do Alqueid\u00e3o (Sobral de Monte Agra\u00e7o), o K30 \u00e0s 09:30 de P\u00earo Negro (Sobral de Monte Agra\u00e7o), o K20 e Caminhada C20 \u00e0s 10:30 do Furadouro (Torres Vedras), o K10 (11:00) e Caminhada C10 (11:10) do Carvalhal (Torres Vedras) e o Trail Kids a partir das 15:00 na Expo Torres.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Linhas de Torres 100 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 4 fases (at\u00e9 30\/09, de 01\/10 a 12\/12, de 13\/12 a 31\/12 e de 01\/01 a 24\/01\/2027): K100 Solo (70 \u20ac a 120 \u20ac), Estafeta Duplas K100\/2 (40 \u20ac a 60 \u20ac por elemento), Estafeta K100\/4 (18 \u20ac a 30 \u20ac por elemento), K50 (35 \u20ac a 50 \u20ac), K30 (24 \u20ac a 30 \u20ac), K20 (16 \u20ac a 22 \u20ac), Caminhada C20 (12 \u20ac a 18 \u20ac), K10 (10 \u20ac a 15 \u20ac) e Caminhada C10 (8 \u20ac a 12 \u20ac). As provas Trail Kids (7 aos 15 anos) s\u00e3o gratuitas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe transporte da meta para os locais de partida e qual o tempo limite?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza autocarros a partir da Expo Torres (Torres Vedras) para as partidas mediante reserva no ato de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o (5 \u20ac para K100, 4 \u20ac para estafetas e K50, 3 \u20ac para K30\/K20\/C20 e 2 \u20ac para K10\/C10). Os tempos limite m\u00e1ximos s\u00e3o de 24 horas (K100 e estafetas), 13 horas (K50), 9 horas (K30), 8 horas (K20), 10 horas (C20) e 4 horas (K10 e C10).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e qual a sua vertente solid\u00e1ria?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Trilhos do Costume, com certifica\u00e7\u00e3o da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA) e homologa\u00e7\u00e3o da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa, revertendo fundos a favor da APSA \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de S\u00edndrome de Asperger.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Linhas de Torres 100 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-29\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Expo Torres, Torres Vedras (Meta e Secretariado)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Torres Vedras\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Linhas de Torres 100 2027 realiza-se a 29 e 30 de janeiro em Torres Vedras. Provas de 100 km, 50 km, 30 km, 20 km, 10 km e caminhadas. Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-linhas-de-torres-100.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"LT100 \u2013 K100 (Ultra Endurance Solo)\", \"price\": \"75.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Linhas-de-Torres-100-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"LT100 \u2013 K100\/2 (Estafetas de 2 Atletas)\", \"price\": \"45.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Linhas-de-Torres-100-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"LT100 \u2013 K100\/4 (Estafetas de at\u00e9 4 Atletas)\", \"price\": \"20.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Linhas-de-Torres-100-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"LT100 \u2013 K50 (Trail Ultra)\", \"price\": \"40.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Linhas-de-Torres-100-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"LT100 \u2013 K30 (Trail Longo)\", \"price\": \"26.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Linhas-de-Torres-100-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"LT100 \u2013 K20 (Trail Sprint)\", \"price\": \"18.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Linhas-de-Torres-100-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"LT100 \u2013 C20 (Caminhada 20 km)\", \"price\": \"14.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Linhas-de-Torres-100-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"LT100 \u2013 K10 (Trail Jovem \/ Curto)\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Linhas-de-Torres-100-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"LT100 \u2013 C10 (Caminhada Ecol\u00f3gica)\", \"price\": \"9.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Linhas-de-Torres-100-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"LT100 \u2013 TK (Trail Kids 7-15 anos)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/Linhas-de-Torres-100-2027\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Trilhos do Costume\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Linhas de Torres 100 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Linhas de Torres 100 2027 decorre nos dias 29 e 30 de janeiro de 2027. O secretariado, o centro log\u00edstico e a meta de todas as dist\u00e2ncias est\u00e3o sediados na Expo Torres, em Torres Vedras.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os locais e hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada dist\u00e2ncia?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na sexta-feira (29 de janeiro), os 100 km (K100 a solo e estafetas K100\/2 e K100\/4) partem \u00e0s 22:00 do Monumento a H\u00e9rcules, em Alhandra (Vila Franca de Xira). No s\u00e1bado (30 de janeiro), o K50 parte \u00e0s 08:15 do N\u00facleo de Apoio ao Forte do Alqueid\u00e3o (Sobral de Monte Agra\u00e7o), o K30 \u00e0s 09:30 de P\u00earo Negro (Sobral de Monte Agra\u00e7o), o K20 e Caminhada C20 \u00e0s 10:30 do Furadouro (Torres Vedras), o K10 (11:00) e Caminhada C10 (11:10) do Carvalhal (Torres Vedras) e o Trail Kids a partir das 15:00 na Expo Torres.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Linhas de Torres 100 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 4 fases (at\u00e9 30\/09, de 01\/10 a 12\/12, de 13\/12 a 31\/12 e de 01\/01 a 24\/01\/2027): K100 Solo (70 \u20ac a 120 \u20ac), Estafeta Duplas K100\/2 (40 \u20ac a 60 \u20ac por elemento), Estafeta K100\/4 (18 \u20ac a 30 \u20ac por elemento), K50 (35 \u20ac a 50 \u20ac), K30 (24 \u20ac a 30 \u20ac), K20 (16 \u20ac a 22 \u20ac), Caminhada C20 (12 \u20ac a 18 \u20ac), K10 (10 \u20ac a 15 \u20ac) e Caminhada C10 (8 \u20ac a 12 \u20ac). As provas Trail Kids (7 aos 15 anos) s\u00e3o gratuitas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existe transporte da meta para os locais de partida e qual o tempo limite?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza autocarros a partir da Expo Torres (Torres Vedras) para as partidas mediante reserva no ato de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o (5 \u20ac para K100, 4 \u20ac para estafetas e K50, 3 \u20ac para K30\/K20\/C20 e 2 \u20ac para K10\/C10). Os tempos limite m\u00e1ximos s\u00e3o de 24 horas (K100 e estafetas), 13 horas (K50), 9 horas (K30), 8 horas (K20), 10 horas (C20) e 4 horas (K10 e C10).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o evento e qual a sua vertente solid\u00e1ria?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Trilhos do Costume, com certifica\u00e7\u00e3o da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA) e homologa\u00e7\u00e3o da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa, revertendo fundos a favor da APSA \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de S\u00edndrome de Asperger.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":72664,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,1491,22,497,622,739,498,499],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-43303","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-torres-vedras-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-estafetas","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-endurance","event_type-kids-trail","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"